<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR EASES TO 11.34PCT FROM 11.50PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR EASES TO 11.34PCT FROM 11.50PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) for one month eased to 11.33 percent from 11.50</p>
<p>percent and the bid rate (Athibid) fell to 10.63 percent from</p>
<p>10.84 percent.</p>
